WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:09,030
A strong cold air hit all parts of the world last night

2
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:11,110
leading to drastic changes in global temperatures

3
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:13,510
The temperature has generally dropped to 70 to 100 degrees Celsius

4
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:15,350
About the reason for this cold air coming

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,070
The meteorological department is investigating

6
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:20,310
In the next few days, I hope everyone will pay attention to keeping warm and not getting hurt.

7
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:22,070
Try not to go out if it is not necessary

8
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:24,110
Don't panic. The blood will pass quickly.

9
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:26,910
If you want to survive after the ice comes, you can only rely on yourself

10
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,830
What if I just stay at home and do nothing?

11
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,190
They must be the first ones to die.

12
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:33,070
Yesterday, the highest temperature in Tianhai time during the day was still 15 degrees

13
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,910
Then cool down by 80 degrees

14
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:46,900
Why did you suddenly hang up the phone? You have some brains?

15
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,940
I know that much blood

16
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,460
Food will become very expensive

17
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:51,660
I don’t want to go out in the ultra-low temperature of minus 60 or 70 degrees Celsius.

18
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:52,700
Just want to ask me for food

19
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,180
In my previous life, I was deceived by Fang Yuqin

20
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,700
I gave her a lot of food from my own home until the end

21
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,900
Fang Yuqin actually planned to kill a woman like me
